{"title":"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Alternate_Solutions?\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate Solutions?</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/6/446dcf4bf7451322f4569873583ff990a5753d0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^2+x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"114\" height=\"19\" /> prove that the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/6/776c4d596da58cc41e39bbfb04a92f1852783016.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(a)=f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" /> has no solutions in positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/8/6583a799ce46b06b1cceb493abb45a07c88fd6c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b.$\" width=\"11\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Directly plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> into the function, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/b/3eb30ea969ab8cdc15bd37edb38d1cf5a3c9fa64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2+4a=b^2+b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"140\" height=\"16\" /> We now have a quadratic in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/e/45ef9cdc7c7d46920eac603663914e0d9261a99b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />\n</p><p>Applying the quadratic formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/8/f08b668f568ed9856a13822724e2e725aeec4759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{-1\\pm \\sqrt{b^2+b+1}}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"178\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>In order for both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to be integers, the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Discriminant\" title=\"Discriminant\">discriminant</a> must be a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Perfect_square\" title=\"Perfect square\">perfect square</a>.  However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1d0aba2653f3404ae9b1a799f356ce0b6bb72fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2&lt; b^2+b+1 &lt;(b+1)^2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"205\" height=\"19\" /> the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/5/035b7af3015dd37c1b6185f496390353008f35bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2+b+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> cannot be a perfect square when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer. Hence, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive integer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> cannot be.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose there exist positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264cf0e07fe59f9af627f9d43b8710c66dfad6a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(a) = f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1b23c6b344cebd6ecb9d63229f82001e95b98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4a = b^2 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/1/161e8de2fef5457f575459ff0d2a5e87bee41e6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2a+1)^2 = b^2 + b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"171\" height=\"19\" />. Then in order for the original equation to be true, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d58b9a649d5ed88cb262f4b13136c5ff4641b92e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} + b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> would have to be a perfect square. Completing the square of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d58b9a649d5ed88cb262f4b13136c5ff4641b92e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} + b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a682c6fd44a623c39ed8836a90156b2cff672d3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b+1/2)^{2} + 3/4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"130\" height=\"21\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/8/d58b9a649d5ed88cb262f4b13136c5ff4641b92e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{2} + b + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />  is not a perfect square, and thus there is no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264cf0e07fe59f9af627f9d43b8710c66dfad6a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(a) = f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose there exist positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264cf0e07fe59f9af627f9d43b8710c66dfad6a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(a) = f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1b23c6b344cebd6ecb9d63229f82001e95b98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4a = b^2 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/9/199774a6db9de1ee2c291530463e55bbe8146e05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4a^2 - b^2) + (4a - b) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"198\" height=\"21\" />. This LHS can be factored to give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/d/8dd0cde763f6b04085f3ff34f6c28620e92f42c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4a - b)(4a + b + 1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"192\" height=\"20\" />. Now, there are 2 cases.\n</p><p>Case 1: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/b/c9be4af82f8ca12ff6297044b6a76c0a482bc184.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a - b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"16\" /> = 0. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/d/00db28ff9e402ed781f89e311bbc6c346fee8ad0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a = b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1b23c6b344cebd6ecb9d63229f82001e95b98a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4a = b^2 + b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"137\" height=\"16\" /> give <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b2510f39a8db4c055596ef9290f790b53c3310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 + 4a = 16a^2 + 4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"169\" height=\"18\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/2/3d278b1b621d7f05e8b9af660546684455b2d067.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a^2 = 16a^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/9/b5969c2cfb1ffadf981fbbddcf796c8eb0037546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> isn't positive.\n</p><p>Case 2: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/8/0681abe4c16deb2d5a6f29db85c733a6cfbe2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a + b + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"115\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4c5574cc1ae593cac76d382f7a965cc062a994.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a = -(b + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> must be positive, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/4/de4666d5b88a5a12f9055189db2a68e4135c67f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" /> must be be positive, meaning <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/e/b8e1ecf4951b46ed2a4fe09dc9c142054f35d706.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + 1 &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/4/ff40c3b4343767addc4880a72634a0c66ac1b048.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b &lt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"16\" />, meaning b must be negative. \n</p><p>Therefore, there is no <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> that satisfies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/4/264cf0e07fe59f9af627f9d43b8710c66dfad6a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4f(a) = f(b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~adi2011\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Alternate_Solutions.3F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_Solutions?\">Alternate Solutions?</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Alternate Solutions?\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Alternate solutions are always welcome. If you have a different, elegant solution to this problem, please <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">add it</a> to this page.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO\">1977 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1977 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017172515\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 294/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1354/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 68/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8576/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.892      1 -total\n 64.01%   10.813      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box\n 34.67%    5.857      1 Template:Alternate_solutions\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3459:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017172515 and revision id 286486. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}